.TH Path.is_symlink 3 2026-09-01 "Tomo man-pages"
.SH NAME
Path.is_symlink \- check if a path is a symbolic link
.SH LIBRARY
Tomo Standard Library
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.BI Path.is_symlink\ :\ func(path:\ Path\ ->\ Bool)
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Checks if the path represents a symbolic link.


.SH ARGUMENTS

.TS
allbox;
lb lb lbx
l l l.
Name	Type	Description
path	Path	The path to check. 
.TE
.SH RETURN
`yes` if the path is a symbolic link, otherwise `no`.

.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
assert (./link).is_symlink()
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR Tomo-Path (3)
